I've been trying to figure out whether bypass movement is permitted through the open terrain of a building hex which is blazing away? The rules state that any unit in a 'blaze location' is eliminated. I believe the open terrain surrounding a building is a seperate location and that bypass should be possible so long as the unit does not end it's move in bypass mode (which isn't permitted to begin with).

The open terrain surrounding a building is NOT a separate location, it is all one and the same location. So bypassing a blaze hex is not allowed.

